#: bd9e499e1ef24edcb56399703ff576e6 e833edab556b4fd48f3ec48d60ceed78
msgid ""
"For full duplex like CRSF/ELRS use both RX1 and TX1 and set "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` also to 3."
msgstr ""
"对于 CRSF/ELRS 等全双工协议，同时使用 RX1 和 TX1，并将 :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` 也设置为 3。"

